<template name="post-like-recovery"><view wx:if="{{postLikeMutation.frozen || postLikeMutation.receiptStatus || postLikeMutation.error}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">点赞结果恢复</view><view class="notice">{{postLikeMutation.actionLabel}} · {{postLikeMutation.status}}</view><view wx:if="{{postLikeMutation.error}}" class="error">{{postLikeMutation.error}}</view><view class="status">{{postLikeMutation.receiptStatus}}</view><view wx:if="{{postLikeMutation.frozen}}"><button bindtap="onPostLikeReceipt" disabled="{{postLikeMutation.busy}}">查询原点赞回执</button><button bindtap="onPostLikeRetry" disabled="{{postLikeMutation.busy}}">重试完全相同的原点赞请求</button><navigator wx:if="{{postLikeMutation.recoveryPostId}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{postLikeMutation.recoveryPostId}}">原帖子与恢复入口 →</navigator></view><button wx:if="{{postLikeMutation.busy}}" bindtap="onPostLikeCancel">停止等待（不撤销请求）</button><view class="notice">未确认的点赞不会被取消或其他帖子的新意图覆盖；关闭页面、换账号或重启后，仍保留在原账号下。回执只确认当时的意图，当前点赞与赞数需重新读取。</view></view></template>
